{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26227","headline":"夜酌溪楼 · 殷尧藩","name":"夜酌溪楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楼居溪上凉生早，坐对城头起暮笳。\n打鼓泊船何处客，捣衣隔竹是谁家。\n玉绳低转宵初迥，银烛高烧月近斜。\n得意引杯须痛饮，好怀那许负年华。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"殷尧藩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26227.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26227","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}